[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11167.51, "timestamp": "03:06:07", "text": "，到底怎麼回事？」然後我聽到另一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11170.309, "timestamp": "03:06:10", "text": "慌亂的聲音，但感覺 Eon 非常害怕。他將在睡夢中死去。他一定是睡夢中死的。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11173.19, "timestamp": "03:06:13", "text": "天啊。喬克會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11181.11, "timestamp": "03:06:21", "text": "殺了所有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11195.11, "timestamp": "03:06:35", "text": "我視訊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11200.15, "timestamp": "03:06:40", "text": "喬正在使用虛擬實境設備。他正在玩虛擬"}]